An ideal short joins $X$ to the bottom rail. Find the current from the cell.
\sol[3.0cm]{%
Short forces $X$ onto the bottom-rail colour.
$8\,\Omega$ and right $4\,\Omega$ bypassed $\Rightarrow$ $I=12/4=3.0\,\mathrm{A}$.
}

