In the circuit above, the steady current through the bulb is $I$.
\begin{enumerate}[label=(\alph*),itemsep=0.05em,topsep=0.25em,leftmargin=1.6em]
  \item How long must the current flow before a total charge of $2\,\mathrm{C}$ has passed through
        the bulb?
  \item In that time, $12\,\mathrm{J}$ of electrical energy is converted in the bulb.
        What is the p.d.\ $V_{PQ}$?
