Colour left rail red, right rail blue. Both branches run red$\to$blue, so they share $\mathcal{E}$.
$\mathcal{E}=6I_{\mathrm{top}}=12I_{\mathrm{bot}}$.
$1=4I_{\mathrm{top}}-6I_{\mathrm{bot}}=2\mathcal{E}/3-\mathcal{E}/2=\mathcal{E}/6$
$\Rightarrow\mathcal{E}=6\,\mathrm{V}$.
