Typical values: copper $\rho\approx 1.7\times 10^{-8}\,\Omega\,\mathrm{m}$;
silicon $\sim 10^{3}\,\Omega\,\mathrm{m}$; polystyrene $\sim 10^{15}\,\Omega\,\mathrm{m}$ (insulator).

